# subrosia-and-dungeon.route's keys for the compact text, which closes seven of its fifteen dialogues in fewer boxes:
# each of those dialogues' keys kept up to the press the compact text closes it on, the directions the recording held
# when the game's own layout closed it set at that frame, and every later key moved as many frames earlier (197 in
# all). The same 27 rooms as the recording, each entered as many frames sooner as the dialogues before it saved, on
# SameBoy and mGBA.
